  "name": "IHC - H3K27m/H3K27me3",
  "code": "1701",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<h4 data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"891\"><strong data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"890\">H3K27M</strong>:</h4>\n<ul data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"1113\">\n<li data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"1024\">\n<p data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"907\"><strong data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"906\">Positive</strong>:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1024\">\n<li data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"950\">\n<p data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"950\">Strong nuclear staining in tumor cells</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1024\">\n<p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1024\">Diagnostic of <strong data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1024\">Diffuse Midline Glioma, H3K27-altered (WHO Grade 4)</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1113\">\n<p data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1040\"><strong data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1039\">Negative</strong>:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1113\">\n<li data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1113\">\n<p data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1113\">Rules out mutation, not consistent with midline glioma H3K27-altered</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1136\"><strong data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1135\">H3K27me3</strong>:</h4>\n<ul data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1383\">\n<li data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1293\">\n<p data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1162\"><strong data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1161\">Loss of Expression</strong>:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1293\">\n<li data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1228\">\n<p data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1228\">Seen in <strong data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1228\">Malignant Peripheral Nerve Sheath Tumors (MPNSTs)</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1293\">\n<p data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1293\">Suggests aggressive phenotype with PRC2 complex inactivation</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1383\">\n<p data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1320\"><strong data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1319\">Retained Expression</strong>:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1383\">\n<li data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1383\">\n<p data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1383\">Seen in benign neural tumors like schwannoma, neurofibroma</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
